UPDATE companies SET description='Central Arkansas Truck Outfitters was founded in 2019 in Bryant, Arkansas, by Carl Gann. After more than 35 years in the automotive industry, including a stint as general manager at T&B Auto Sales, Gann recognized a lack of local truck upfitting services in central Arkansas and opened the shop to fill that gap.

The company operates a full-service upfitting facility where it sells, installs, and fabricates work-truck equipment. Services include installation of Royal and Warner service bodies, flatbeds, Weather Guard and Ranger Design van shelving, Bedrock truck beds, Transfer Flow auxiliary fuel tanks, Kargo Master ladder racks, Feniex emergency lighting, and towing hardware from CURT, B&W, and NSA RV. The shop also performs custom welding and fabrication on-site, handles tonneau covers, lift kits, running boards, toolboxes, bed liners, and bumpers, and provides fleet outfitting for contractors and businesses. All work is done in-house at the Bryant location.

Customers come from across central Arkansas — including Bryant, Benton, Little Rock, North Little Rock, Conway, Hot Springs, Maumelle, and Cabot — and represent contractors, service technicians, first responders, field crews, and fleet operators. As Arkansas’ exclusive dealer for Royal Truck Body, the shop supplies service bodies and flatbeds by fleets and contractors statewide. Membership in the Work Truck Association (NTEA) connects the company with commercial vehicle manufacturers and distributors.

Gann started the business after seeing that his former employer had to outsource upfitting work miles away, and he believed other local businesses faced the same challenge. The company emphasizes 100% in-house installation, a roster of 22 authorized dealer brands, and hands-on involvement from the owner to ensure parts fit correctly and jobs are done right.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Service body installation (Royal, Warner)", "Flatbed installation", "Van upfitting (Weather Guard, Ranger Design)", "Hitch installation and towing equipment (CURT, B&W, NSA RV)", "Tonneau cover installation", "Lift kit and leveling kit installation", "Truck accessory installation (running boards, toolboxes, bed liners, bumpers)", "Custom welding and fabrication", "Fleet outfitting", "Emergency lighting installation (Feniex)", "Auxiliary fuel tank installation (Transfer Flow)", "Ladder rack installation (Kargo Master)", "Bedrock truck bed installation", "Royal High Profile Service Body installation", "Royal Cutaway Mount installation", "Royal Crane Body Standard installation"], "industries": ["Contractors", "Service technicians", "First responders", "Field crews", "Fleet operators"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Arkansas\u2019 only Royal Truck Body dealer", "100% in-house installation", "22 authorized dealer brands", "Custom welding and fabrication on-site", "NTEA (Work Truck Association) member"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2019 in Bryant, Arkansas -> db", "Owner Carl Gann with 35 years automotive experience -> /about-us", "Started after noticing need for local upfitting while GM at T&B Auto Sales -> /about-us", "Arkansas\u2019 only Royal Truck Body dealer -> /", "100% In-House Installation -> /", "22 Authorized Dealer Brands -> /", "Custom welding and fabrication done on-site -> /", "NTEA (Work Truck Association) member -> /", "Serves contractors, service techs, first responders, field c