ies & Krump 90-ton press brake (120\" long)", "All Steel 50-ton press brake (96\" long)", "Strippit Houdaille FC-1000 III CNC turret punch press (HECC-80 control)", "Strippit Houdaille FC-1000 III CNC turret punch press with auto indexing (GN6 & OP controls)", "Syncrowave 350LX TIG welder", "Oxyacetylene welding & cutting unit", "Electronic controlled air operated resistance spot welders (20-75 KVA)", "Back belt & back stands (4\" wide)", "Ultramatic vibrator for polishing & deburring", "Falls Metal deburring machines", "Roto Finish Gemini 7 cu ft bowl type vibratory finisher", "Wysong & Miles 10'' 10ga power shear", "Wysong & Miles 6'' 10ga power shear", "Assorted OBI & straight side punch presses (30-125 ton)", "Haeger Pem Setter automatic feed", "Floor type drill press with tapping head", "Floor type automatic feed riveting machines", "Flex arm tapping system", "Milling machine reversible head 30\" travel", "K.O. Lee surface grinder 36\" travel", "South Bend lathe", "Marvel floor model saw 8\" capacity", "Heavy-duty drill presses", "Powermatic automatic feed drill press"], "volume": "Small, medium, and large volume runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated since 1912, currently fifth generation", "Lights-out fiber laser cutting with automation tower", "In-house 3D solid modeling engineering (SolidWorks)", "Contract finishing management (powder coat, e-coat, paint, plate, anodize)", "Small to large volume runs with multiple part-mix capability"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1912, family-owned, fifth generation Silverstein family -> /about", "Headquarters Skokie, Illinois -> db", "Precision sheet metal fabricator: brackets, enclosures, housings, chassis, faceplates, panels, covers, rack-mount components, OEM part housings -> /, /capabilities", "Processes: fiber laser cutting with lights-out automation, CNC bending/forming, CNC turret punching, welding/spot welding, drilling/tapping/countersinking, hardware insertion, shearing, vi