UPDATE companies SET description='Charlotte Wire & Cable Company Inc. was founded in 1993 by Mike Biggers in Concord, North Carolina. The company operates from a combined 150,000-square-foot warehouse and office facility in the Charlotte metropolitan area. Biggers remains president and founder, and the business has maintained a policy of selling exclusively through the electrical distribution channel since its inception.

The company stocks more than 2,000 wire and cable products, including building wire, utility wire, and specialized cables for industrial, commercial, and infrastructure applications. It functions as a wholesale distributor, providing 24/7 emergency service year‑round and emphasizing prompt, courteous customer support.

Charlotte Wire & Cable serves four primary industry segments: industrial and manufacturing, residential and commercial construction, utility and infrastructure, and logistics and transportation. Its customer base consists of electrical distributors who rely on the company’s product breadth and distribution expertise to supply end‑users in those sectors.

Biggers has stated that the company’s founding principle was to support the electrical distribution channel rather than compete with it, a policy that continues to guide operations. The firm highlights its team’s average of over 12 years of industry experience, its round‑the‑clock emergency response, and its commitment to on‑time delivery as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wire and cable distribution", "24/7 emergency service", "Electrical distribution channel sales", "Dedicated customer service", "Product selection support"], "industries": ["Industrial & Manufacturing", "Residential & Commercial", "Utility & Infrastructure", "Logistics & Transportation"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100% of sales through electrical distribution channel since 1993", "24/7 emergency service including holidays", "Over 2,000 wire and cable products in stock", "150,000 sq ft warehouse and office space", "Team averages over 12 years of industry experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1993 -> db", "Headquarters in Concord, North Carolina -> db", "Founder Mike Biggers, President & Founder -> homepage", "Over 2,000 stock items -> homepage", "Combined 150,000 sq ft warehouse and office space -> homepage", "100% of sales through electrical distribution channel since 1993 -> homepage", "24/7 emergency service including holidays -> homepage", "Industries served: Industrial & Manufacturing, Residential & Commercial, Utility & Infrastructure, Logistics & Transportation -> homepage", "Team averages over 12 years of industry experience -> homepage", "Company operates as a wire and cable distributor -> homepage"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "All sales 100% through the distribution channel since 1993", "founded_year": "1993", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "soc