UPDATE companies SET description='Cherry Brook Woodworks operates from Canton, Connecticut, where in 2001 founder Peter Aleksa and his family converted two historic apple barns on their property into a woodworking shop. The business remains family-run, with Aleksa’s wife and sons supporting the operation.

