UPDATE companies SET description='Clarus Medical operates from Minneapolis, Minnesota, where it has spent more than three decades designing and manufacturing small-diameter medical endoscopes. The company does not disclose a specific founding year or ownership structure in its public materials.

The company produces a range of medical devices including airway and intubation scopes, minimally invasive spine instruments, inspection borescopes, and neuroendoscopy systems. It also provides private-label and OEM manufacturing services for other medical companies. All products are built in an ISO 13485 certified cleanroom, though the facility’s square footage and employee count are not publicly specified.

Clarus Medical serves the medical device industry, supplying both its own branded endoscopes and acting as an OEM partner for other medical technology firms.

