UPDATE companies SET description='Clemens Food Group was founded in Hatfield, Pennsylvania, six generations ago and has operated continuously for more than 130 years. The business remains a sixth-generation, family-owned enterprise, rooted in the small independent farms that formed its early legacy.

Today the company operates a fully vertically coordinated pork supply chain. Its network includes a feed mill that formulates diets for sow, nursery, and finishing farms; a farming division, Country View Family Farms, comprising over 250 company-owned and independent family farms across Indiana, Michigan, Ohio, and Pennsylvania; three pork processing facilities in Hatfield and Tyrone, Pennsylvania, and Coldwater, Michigan; and a dedicated logistics and transportation fleet that moves live hogs and finished products to customers. This integration allows the company to control every step from feed to delivery.

The company emphasizes flexible, responsive service for customers of all sizes, from independent restaurants to national chains, leveraging its integrated system to ensure consistent quality and supply reliability.

The company’s differentiation rests on its ownership of the entire production process, a model it describes as "vertically and purposefully coordinated." Leadership cites core values of Ethics, Integrity, and Stewardship as the foundation for decisions, and the Farm Promise® brand markets a No Antibiotics Ever, sustainably raised pork program. This approach, they say, builds a responsive, flexible system that benefits the community, the environment, and the end consumer.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Feed milling", "Hog farming (sow, nursery, finisher)", "Pork processing", "Logistics and transportation", "Animal welfare and biosecurity management", "Sustainable farming practices"], "industries": ["Foodservice", "Retail", "Food manufacturing"], "materials": ["Pork", "Hogs"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Full vertical integration from feed milling through transportation", "Ownership of every process ensures consistent quality", "Network of 250+ company-owned and independent family farms", "No Antibiotics Ever pork program (Farm Promise\u00ae)", "Sixth-generation family ownership guided by Ethics, Integrity, Stewardship"], "facts_used": ["Founded in Hatfield, Pennsylvania six generations ago -> /", "More than 130 years in business -> /", "Sixth-generation family-owned company -> /", "Vertically coordinated: feed milling, farming, food processing, transportation -> /", "Pork processing facilities in Hatfield and Tyrone, PA and Coldwater, MI -> /", "Country View Family Farms network of over 250 company-owned and independent family farms -> /", "Brands: Hatfield, Kunzler, Farm Promise, Prima Porta -> /", "Core values: Ethics, Integrity, Stewardship -> /", "No Antibiotics Ever pork program (Farm Promise) -> /", "Headquartered in Hatfield, PA -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Our pork processing facilities are located in Hatfield and Tyrone, Pe