UPDATE companies SET description='Cleverhood operates from Providence, Rhode Island, where it designs and manufactures a line of technical rainwear. The company runs its own garment production and sells directly through an online shop built on Shopify, serving customers across a long list of international markets.

The product range centers on fully waterproof outerwear built for active use: the Rover Anorak and Rover Rain Cape for cyclists, the Urbanaut Trench for urban wear, plus accessories such as Zipsters and hats.

The brand targets cyclists, urban commuters, and outdoor enthusiasts who need reliable rain protection without sacrificing appearance. WIRED magazine named one of its jackets the "Best Rain Jacket For Cycling," and customer testimonials cite touring musicians, daily bike commuters, and dog walkers who value the combination of coverage, pocket placement, and tailored fit.

