UPDATE companies SET description='Cole Wire & Cable Co., Inc. was founded in 1979 by Shel and Teri Cole in Lincolnshire, Illinois. The family-owned business has grown into one of the nation''s largest master stocking distributors of specialty electrical and electronic wire and cable. Now led by second-generation owner Leo Cole, the company operates from a 26,000-square-foot combined office and warehouse in Lincolnshire, with additional sales offices in Ohio, and serves customers across the U.S. and internationally in Canada, Mexico, the United Kingdom, and China.

The company maintains a multi-million-dollar inventory of wire and cable products, including portable cord, tray cable, hook-up wire, armored cable, power cable, low-voltage wire, and electronic wire and cable. Its custom manufacturing capabilities cover wire harnesses, cord sets, coil cords, and tailored assemblies for OEM, automotive, aerospace, and industrial applications, scalable from prototype to thousands of units.

Cole Wire serves OEMs and manufacturers with precise wire configurations bundled and stripped for production-line efficiency; construction and electrical contractors with custom-cut, labeled, and job-ready cable; marine and offshore clients with rugged, corrosion-resistant cable; and specialty contractors needing pump cables, high-temperature wire, and heavy-duty custom solutions. The company also supports automotive, aerospace, and general industrial sectors.

