UPDATE companies SET description='Comfort Foods Co-packing & Processing has operated from Albuquerque, New Mexico for over 30 years. The company began with a goal to provide high-quality, delicious, healthy ingredients and custom blends to customers seeking flexible co-packing solutions.

The 44,000-square-foot facility houses blending and packaging lines that handle both wet and dry products. Capabilities span custom blending, custom packaging, co-packaging, custom formulation, and private label manufacturing. Production runs accommodate volumes from less than half an ounce up to 50-pound bulk packs, with wet options such as salsas, barbecue sauces, jellies, salad dressings, and condiments, and dry options including seasoning blends, soup mixes, bread mixes, dip mixes, and dessert mixes. Packaging formats range from bulk containers to plastic and glass bottles, pouches, packets, portion cups, and cartons.

Customers bring their own formulations, request proprietary development, or select from Comfort Foods'' house recipes.

Comfort Foods emphasizes quality assurance through a full-time QC staff and programs that include SQF with Costco addendum certification, HACCP, allergen control, FDA compliance, recall procedures, sample retention, metal detection, GMP adherence, and Kosher certification. Membership in the Contract Manufacturers Association further underscores its focus on industry standards.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF with Costco addendum','HACCP','Kosher certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom blending", "Custom packaging", "Co-packaging", "Custom formulation", "Private label manufacturing", "Wet product manufacturing (salsas, sauces, dressings)", "Dry product manufacturing (seasoning blends, soup mixes, bread mixes, dip mixes, dessert mixes)", "Bulk packaging", "Bottle packaging (plastic/glass)", "Pouch/packet packaging", "Portion cup packaging", "Carton packaging", "Quality assurance (SQF, HACCP, allergen control, FDA compliance)", "Kosher certification", "Metal detection", "Sample retention", "Recall program", "Third-party audit program"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Blending lines", "Packaging lines", "Metal detector"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["44,000 sq ft facility with blending and packaging lines", "Packaging range from less than 1/2 oz to 50-lb bulk packs", "Wet and dry production capabilities", "SQF with Costco addendum and HACCP certified", "Kosher certified"], "facts_used": ["Company located in Albuquerque, NM -> db", "Facility size 44,000 sq ft -> /", "Celebrating 30 years -> /", "Custom blending and packaging services -> /", "Wet and dry production capabilities -> /", "Packaging options: bulk, bottles, pouches, portion cups, cartons -> /", "Quality certifications: SQF with Costco addendum, HACCP, Kosher -> /", "Member of Contract Manufacturers Association -> /", "Address: 9900 Montgomery Blvd NE, Suite A, Albuquerque, NM 87111 -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "make